<h1>Termite Protection System Client Detail Form</h1>

<p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);"><%= format_date(today, :long) %></p>

<p>
  Regardless of the termite system used, it is extremely important that regular inspections
  be carried out by a QBCC licenced contractor with the appropriate Termite Management licence.
  This form, once completed, will be provided to our termite treatment provider. They will
  contact you to arrange for your regular servicing requirements.
</p>

<p><strong>Please complete the details below and return as part of the contract documentation.</strong></p>

<h2>Homeowner Details</h2>

<table>
  <tr>
    <td style="width: 30%; background: #f5f5f5;"><strong>Homeowner Name/s</strong></td>
    <td><%= @client_names %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background: #f5f5f5;"><strong>Job Address</strong></td>
    <td><%= @job[:full_address] %></td>
  </tr>
  <% if @client_1.present? %>
  <tr>
    <td style="background: #f5f5f5;"><strong>Mailing Address</strong></td>
    <td><%= [@client_1[:address], @client_1[:city], @client_1[:state], @client_1[:postcode]].compact.join(' ') %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background: #f5f5f5;"><strong>Phone</strong></td>
    <td><%= @client_1[:phone] %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background: #f5f5f5;"><strong>Email</strong></td>
    <td><%= @client_1[:email] %></td>
  </tr>
  <% end %>
</table>

<%= render "signature_block" %>

<h2>Important Information</h2>

<div style="margin: var(--space-4) 0; padding: var(--space-4); background: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #f59e0b;">
  <p style="margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;"><strong>Please also note the following:</strong></p>
  <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: var(--space-6);">
    <li>
      The builder will be able to provide you with the certification and documentation for
      the termite treatment that has been installed at your property. It is extremely important
      that these documents are read and followed. These will be provided as part of your handover kit.
    </li>
    <li>
      You may also be required to complete a Warranty Activation Form. Please refer to your
      handover documentation.
    </li>
    <li>
      If you change your contact details, please let the builder and termite provider know
      as soon as possible.
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div style="margin-top: var(--space-8); padding-top: var(--space-4); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--color-text-muted);">
    <strong><%= @job[:full_address] %></strong><br>
    <%= @company[:name] %> | QBCC Licence <%= @company[:qbcc_license] %>
  </p>
</div>
